@startuml Sequence - OTP Timers & Errors
skinparam monochrome true
actor User
participant FE
participant MTA


User -> FE : Request OTP
FE -> MTA : Send OTP
MTA --> User : code (ttl=3m)
User -> FE : Submit code
alt Invalid code
FE --> User : "인증번호가 올바르지 않습니다"
else Expired
FE --> User : Resend option, timer reset
else Success
FE --> User : Next step enabled
end
@enduml
